{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 5",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632957693904028650 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632904007098040981&sectionId=632957693904028650)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNX3sWCNnQ_text","label":"ggNX3sWCNnQ_text","default":"<p>Life changes quickly. Children grow up, families move, friendships evolve, and everyday routines eventually become memories.</p><p>A photograph gives you a way to pause and remember how things looked and felt during a particular moment in your life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why an ordinary photograph can become incredibly valuable. It does not have to show a major accomplishment. It simply has to remind you of something you never want to forget.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most people have hundreds or even thousands of photographs stored on their phones. Some are important, some are funny, and some have probably been forgotten completely.</p><p>Memobrick gives your favorite photographs a chance to become something more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A meaningful picture can be transformed into a personalized brick mosaic that you can build and display in your home. Instead of scrolling past the photograph on your phone, you can see it every day as part of your décor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your favorite memory becomes something you can physically experience and enjoy.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7--6VBwpA_text","label":"gg7--6VBwpA_text","default":"Build a Memory, Not Just a Decoration"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVUrSJjZ0M_text","label":"ggVUrSJjZ0M_text","default":"<p>One of the things that makes Memobrick special is that the experience starts before the finished piece reaches the wall.</p><p>You get to build the image brick by brick and watch your photograph slowly come together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can build it by yourself, with your partner, with your children, or with friends. While you work on it, you can talk about the photograph, remember the moment it captured, and create a new memory in the process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The finished piece then represents more than a picture. It represents the memory and the experience of creating it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not sure which photograph to choose? Look through your camera roll for moments like these:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>A family dinner</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A spontaneous day out</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A funny moment with friends</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A favorite childhood photo</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A quiet moment with someone you love</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A memorable road trip</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A favorite photo of your pet</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A backyard family gathering</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A simple weekend adventure</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A photograph that always makes you smile</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The perfect picture does not have to be perfect. It simply needs to mean something to you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggP1T-OiRA__text","label":"ggP1T-OiRA__text","default":"Give Your Memories a Place in Your Home"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy4VjOIDhb_text","label":"ggy4VjOIDhb_text","default":"<p>Home décor does not have to be purely decorative. The things around us can also tell the story of who we are.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized Memobrick can bring your favorite memories into the spaces where you spend your everyday life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Place one in the living room, bedroom, office, hallway, or another meaningful space. Instead of simply filling an empty wall, you are creating a space filled with memories.</p><p>And when guests ask about the picture, you have a story to share.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The size of your Memobrick can make a difference depending on the photograph you choose.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Smaller sizes are best suited for close up images with fewer people and simpler compositions. If your photograph contains several people, a pet, a vehicle, or lots of background details, a larger size can give the image more room to show those details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choosing the right size for your photograph helps important subjects remain recognizable and can create a better looking finished mosaic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You do not need to wait for a birthday, holiday, or anniversary to give someone a personalized keepsake.</p><p>A photograph from an ordinary day can make a wonderful surprise gift precisely because it is unexpected.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Give a Memobrick to a parent featuring a favorite family moment. Surprise a partner with a photograph from an unforgettable day together. Turn a funny pet picture into something they can display.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sometimes the most meaningful gifts are the ones that say, <strong>\"I saw this moment, and I knew it was worth remembering.\"</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKOGjjYxQI_text","label":"ggKOGjjYxQI_text","default":"<p>The biggest moments in life deserve to be remembered, but so do the little ones.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A funny afternoon, a family gathering, a spontaneous adventure, or a simple photograph of the people you love can become a treasured memory as the years go by.</p><p>Instead of letting those moments disappear into your camera roll, turn one into something you can build and display.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Because sometimes the little moments become the biggest memories.</strong></p>"}],
